<main><section class="scene cream" id="prologue"><div class="petals" id="petals"></div><div class="inner"><div class="eyebrow reveal">a little something, just for you</div><h1 class="reveal">Dear <i>Siddhi,</i></h1><p class="tiny muted reveal">There is a letter waiting to be opened.</p><div class="envelope-wrap" id="envelope" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Open the letter"><div class="envelope"><div class="letterpeek">A story for you<br>✿</div><div class="flap"></div><div class="seal">S</div></div></div><div class="intro-copy" id="intro"><p class="prose">“Some stories begin so quietly that we only recognize their beauty when we look back.”</p><p class="tiny">I made a little place for the moments worth remembering.</p><button class="pill" onclick="go('garden')">Begin your story &nbsp; ↗</button></div><p class="tiny muted" id="tapnote">Tap the seal to open</p></div></section>
<section class="scene pink" id="garden"><div class="inner"><div class="eyebrow reveal">chapter one · the beginning</div><div class="ornament reveal">✿</div><h2 class="reveal">Somewhere,<br><i>it all began.</i></h2><p class="prose reveal">There were ordinary days, familiar places, and conversations that seemed so small at the time.</p><p class="prose reveal">Yet somewhere among them, without announcing itself, something beautiful began to grow.</p><div class="divider"></div><p class="tiny muted">Touch a flower. Every bloom carries a thought.</p><div class="flower-row" id="flowers"></div><div class="message" id="flowerMessage" aria-live="polite">Even the smallest beginnings can become beautiful stories.</div><button class="pill" onclick="go('memories')">Turn the page ↗</button></div></section>
<section class="scene sepia" id="memories"><div class="inner"><div class="eyebrow reveal">chapter two · the memories</div><h2 class="reveal">A museum of<br><i>little moments.</i></h2><p class="prose reveal">If memories were flowers, I would have an entire garden of moments worth keeping.</p><div class="album reveal"><div class="photo"><span id="memoryArt">The Beginning</span></div><p class="eyebrow" id="memoryDate" style="margin-top:22px">page 01 · once upon a time</p><h3 id="memoryTitle">When Our Paths Crossed</h3><p class="serif" id="memoryText" style="font-size:1.5rem;line-height:1.3">Who could have known that such a simple beginning would become a memory worth treasuring?</p><div class="album-controls"><button class="arrow" id="prev" aria-label="Previous memory">←</button><span class="tiny" id="pageCount">01 / 04</span><button class="arrow" id="next" aria-label="Next memory">→</button></div></div><button class="pill" onclick="go('letters')">The letters await ↗</button></div></section>
<section class="scene cream" id="letters"><div class="inner"><div class="eyebrow reveal">chapter three · the letters</div><h2 class="reveal">Words that deserve<br><i>a place to stay.</i></h2><p class="prose reveal">There are things we say in passing, and things we carry quietly in our hearts.</p><p class="tiny muted">Three letters. Open them in any order.</p><div class="envelopes" id="envelopes"><button class="small-envelope" data-letter="0" aria-label="Open letter for your heart"></button><button class="small-envelope" data-letter="1" aria-label="Open letter for your dreams"></button><button class="small-envelope" data-letter="2" aria-label="Open letter for days ahead"></button></div><div class="letter-panel" id="letterPanel" aria-live="polite"><div class="ornament">✉</div><h3>Choose an envelope</h3><p class="serif" style="font-size:1.5rem">A few words are waiting inside.</p></div><button class="pill" onclick="go('sky')">Follow the starlight ↗</button></div></section>
<section class="scene night" id="sky"><div class="stars" id="stars"></div><div class="inner"><div class="eyebrow reveal" style="color:#d9c39d">chapter four · the universe</div><div class="moon reveal" aria-hidden="true"></div><h2 class="reveal">If the stars<br><i>could speak.</i></h2><p class="prose reveal">There are galaxies beyond our sight, stars beyond our reach, and mysteries beyond our understanding.</p><p class="prose reveal">But sometimes, the greatest wonder is simply finding someone whose presence makes an ordinary day extraordinary.</p><p class="tiny" style="color:#d9c39d">Choose a star to discover a wish</p><div class="star-buttons" id="starButtons"></div><div class="message" id="wishMessage" aria-live="polite" style="color:#f7e8cc">Five stars, five little wishes.</div><button class="pill" onclick="go('eleven')">One unforgettable moment ↗</button></div></section>
<section class="scene dawn" id="eleven"><div class="inner"><div class="eyebrow reveal">chapter five · a moment in time</div><h2 class="reveal">Eleven <i>Eleven.</i></h2><p class="tiny reveal">11 NOVEMBER 2026</p><button class="clock reveal" id="clock" aria-label="Reveal the eleven eleven message"><span>11:11</span></button><p class="prose reveal">A thousand days may pass without leaving a mark upon the calendar of our hearts.</p><p class="prose reveal">And then comes one small moment, so simple and yet so extraordinary, that it becomes a treasure.</p><p class="message" id="clockMessage" aria-live="polite">Touch the clock.</p><button class="pill" onclick="go('finale')">One last letter ↗</button></div></section>
<section class="scene cream" id="finale"><div class="inner"><div class="eyebrow reveal">epilogue · one last thing, siddhi</div><h2 class="reveal">If you ever<br><i>wonder...</i></h2><div class="final-letter reveal"><p>My dearest Siddhi,</p><p>If there is one thing I hope you carry with you from these pages, it is this: you are deeply appreciated.</p><p>Not because every day is perfect. Not because every conversation is extraordinary. But because there is something beautiful about the simple privilege of knowing you.</p><p>I cherish the memories we have made, the laughter we have shared, and the little moments that have quietly become important to me.</p><p>I admire your dreams, your honesty, and the wonderful person you continue to become.</p><p>And while neither of us can know exactly what the future holds, I hope we continue to greet it with kindness, patience, understanding, and courage.</p><p>If I could give you a thousand flowers, I would still want to write you a letter explaining why I chose each one.</p><p>So instead, I made you this little universe. Not because it could ever contain everything I wish to say, but because some feelings deserve a place to be remembered.</p><p>Thank you for being you, Siddhi.</p><p>With all my love,<br><i>Omkar</i> ♡</p></div><button class="pill" onclick="go('ending')">A final little surprise ↗</button></div></section>
<section class="scene night end" id="ending"><div class="stars" id="endStars"></div><div class="inner"><div class="eyebrow reveal" style="color:#d9c39d">the end of this little story</div><div class="ornament reveal" style="color:#e6cba3;margin:28px">☾ ✧</div><h2 class="reveal">And the beginning<br><i>of so many more.</i></h2><p class="prose reveal">Some stories do not need a perfect ending. They only need to have been worth telling.</p><div class="divider"></div><p class="tiny reveal">MADE WITH CARE, ESPECIALLY FOR SIDDHI</p><button class="pill" onclick="go('prologue')" style="margin-top:24px">Read our story again ↺</button></div></section></main><footer>FOR SIDDHI · A LITTLE UNIVERSE CALLED YOU · ♡</footer>
<script>
const $=s=>document.querySelector(s);function go(id){document.getElementById(id).scrollIntoView({behavior:matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches?'instant':'smooth'})}const envelope=$('#envelope');function openEnvelope(){if(envelope.classList.contains('open'))return;envelope.classList.add('open');$('#intro').classList.add('show');$('#tapnote').textContent='A little story, just for you ♡'}envelope.addEventListener('click',openEnvelope);envelope.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='Enter'||e.key===' '){e.preventDefault();openEnvelope()}});
const flowerWords=['Your kindness makes ordinary days brighter.','May your laughter always find a reason to return.','Your dreams deserve room to bloom.','There is beauty in being wonderfully yourself.','Some moments become precious without ever trying.'];$('#flowers').innerHTML=flowerWords.map((x,i)=>`<button class="flower" aria-label="Reveal flower ${i+1}" data-flower="${i}"><span class="stem"></span><span class="leaf"></span><span class="bloom"></span></button>`).join('');document.querySelectorAll('[data-flower]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{document.querySelectorAll('.flower').forEach(f=>f.classList.remove('active'));b.classList.add('active');$('#flowerMessage').textContent=flowerWords[+b.dataset.flower]}));
const memories=[['The Beginning','page 01 · once upon a time','When Our Paths Crossed','Who could have known that such a simple beginning would become a memory worth treasuring?'],['Our Friendship','page 02 · the ordinary days','All Those Little Conversations','Some friendships quietly become part of the language of our lives.'],['Little Gestures','page 03 · moments of kindness','The Things We Remember','A flower, a note, a thoughtful gesture. Sometimes the smallest things carry the greatest meaning.'],['11:11','page 04 · 11 november 2026','A Date to Remember','Some dates are simply numbers. Others become chapters we know we will remember.']];let memoryIndex=0;function renderMemory(){const m=memories[memoryIndex];['memoryArt','memoryDate','memoryTitle','memoryText'].forEach((id,i)=>$('#'+id).textContent=m[i]);$('#pageCount').textContent=`0${memoryIndex+1} / 04`;}$('#prev').onclick=()=>{memoryIndex=(memoryIndex+3)%4;renderMemory()};$('#next').onclick=()=>{memoryIndex=(memoryIndex+1)%4;renderMemory()};
const letters=[['For Your Heart','I hope you always remember that your feelings deserve kindness, your thoughts deserve to be heard, and your heart deserves gentleness. You never have to be perfect to be appreciated. There is beauty in your laughter, your quiet moments, your honesty, and the many little things that make you who you are.'],['For Your Dreams','I hope the world gives you countless opportunities to become everything you wish to be. May you find courage when the road is uncertain, patience when progress feels slow, and joy in every achievement, however small. Your dreams are yours to discover, and I will always wish beautiful things for them.'],['For The Days Ahead','I do not know every chapter that tomorrow will bring. But I hope there will always be room for kindness, laughter, understanding, and the simple happiness of sharing beautiful moments. Whatever the future holds, I am grateful for the story that has already brought us here.']];document.querySelectorAll('[data-letter]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{document.querySelectorAll('.small-envelope').forEach(x=>x.classList.remove('active'));b.classList.add('active');const l=letters[+b.dataset.letter];$('#letterPanel').innerHTML=`<div class="ornament">✿</div><h3>${l[0]}</h3><p class="serif" style="font-size:1.55rem;line-height:1.42">${l[1]}</p><p class="tiny" style="text-align:right">— With love, O.</p>`}));
const wishes=['May your laughter always find a reason to return.','May you never doubt the worth of your dreams.','May kindness find you wherever life takes you.','May you discover beauty in the smallest moments.','May your story always have room for wonder.'];$('#starButtons').innerHTML=wishes.map((w,i)=>`<button class="star-button" data-wish="${i}" aria-label="Reveal wish ${i+1}">✦</button>`).join('');document.querySelectorAll('[data-wish]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{document.querySelectorAll('.star-button').forEach(x=>x.classList.remove('active'));b.classList.add('active');$('#wishMessage').textContent=wishes[+b.dataset.wish]});function populateStars(id,count){const el=document.getElementById(id);let s=17;const rand=()=>{s=(s*16807)%2147483647;return(s-1)/2147483646};for(let i=0;i<count;i++){const d=document.createElement('span');d.className='star';d.style.left=rand()*100+'%';d.style.top=rand()*100+'%';d.style.animationDelay=rand()*4+'s';d.style.width=d.style.height=(rand()*2.4+1)+'px';el.appendChild(d)}}populateStars('stars',115);populateStars('endStars',95);$('#clock').onclick=()=>{$('#clockMessage').textContent='Some moments become memories. Some memories become treasures. ♡'};
